Stores drafts for your tier. Code refuses the whole call and names every fault: a title over 120 characters, a canonical title over 160, a summary over 280, a body outside 200 to 1,800, a mermaid block that doesn't open with a diagram type, a fence left open, a passage outside the grounding, more cards than the tier still needs, more of a form than its quota, or a second hero. Every card carries an art request, what its ASCII art should show and ideas for drawing it, which designer_toad draws once the card is accepted. Send the drafts on with gate_cards.
